*Proof.* Clearly  $BI\perp RS$ . It is sufficient to prove that  $BR\cdot BS=BI\cdot BX$  by *PoP*. Notice the angles: \[ \angle BRM=\angle KML=\angle KLC=\angle LKC=\angle SKB \] Similarly  $\angle RMB=\angle KSB$ . That means  $\triangle BRM\sim \triangle BKS$ . So
