Color the edges alternately black and white (possible since there's an even number of them), so every vertex has black degree  $2$  and white degree  $2$ . Finally, repeat in every component, and send all pebbles in a white pair to one side, and all pebbles in a black pair to the other. Each side contains  $n$  pairs of pebbles with sum of weights  $4n + 1$ , so they both have the same weight.

